Rarity: Only [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal]], [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]], [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare]], [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]] and [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]]

==Battleground==
===<u>Chapter 1 & 2</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Croco|Kroxo|Baa Baa|Shibalien Elite}}
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Croco]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**5 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**7 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.

===<u>Chapter 3</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Croco|Kroxo|Baa Baa|General GreGory|Shibalien Elite}}
*10 [[Croco]]s (3,000%) spawn, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
*10 [[Croco]]s (3,000%) spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s (3,000%) spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Croco]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**5 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**7 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] and/or [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] along with meatshields. [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] will make quick work of the peons, while other ranged attackers like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] can deal with the Shibalien Elites.

